I ran the same five queries on four dataset sizes: 7 exercises (the original Rehab-It exercises), 20 exercises (a random sample of the full set), 54 exercises (the full set from Step 2.2), and 117 exercises (the 54 plus 63 extra exercises written as distractors from other body parts, heavy lifting, high-impact cardio, and yoga). I tested two embedding models, MiniLM and bge-base.
